{"_id":"68a7360f8ec3d8323af133c1","nodeId":"gr8BK6vq4AVwp_aUozZmf","roadmapSlug":"computer-science","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:54.940Z","description":"# Linked Lists\n\nArrays store elements in contiguous memory locations, resulting in easily calculable addresses for the elements stored and this allows faster access to an element at a specific index. Linked lists are less rigid in their storage structure and elements are usually not stored in contiguous locations, hence they need to be stored with additional tags giving a reference to the next element. This difference in the data storage scheme decides which data structure would be more suitable for a given situation.","resources":[{"type":"course","title":"Singly Linked Lists","url":"https://www.coursera.org/lecture/data-structures/singly-linked-lists-kHhgK","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b04"},{"type":"course","title":"Core: Linked Lists vs Arrays","url":"https://www.coursera.org/lecture/data-structures-optimizing-performance/core-linked-lists-vs-arrays-rjBs9","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b05"},{"type":"course","title":"In the Real World: Linked Lists vs Arrays","url":"https://www.coursera.org/lecture/data-structures-optimizing-performance/in-the-real-world-lists-vs-arrays-QUaUd","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b06"},{"type":"course","title":"Doubly Linked Lists","url":"https://www.coursera.org/lecture/data-structures/doubly-linked-lists-jpGKD","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b07"},{"type":"video","title":"Linked List Data Structure | Illustrated Data Structures","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odW9FU8jPRQ","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b08"},{"type":"video","title":"Linked Lists in 4 minutes","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F8AbOfQwl1c","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b09"},{"type":"video","title":"CS 61B Lecture 7: Linked Lists I","url":"https://archive.org/details/ucberkeley_webcast_htzJdKoEmO0","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b0a"},{"type":"video","title":"CS 61B Lecture 7: Linked Lists II","url":"https://archive.org/details/ucberkeley_webcast_-c4I3gFYe3w","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b0b"},{"type":"video","title":"Why you should avoid Linked Lists?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YQs6IC-vgmo","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3b0c"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:21.077Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/computer-science/content/gr8BK6vq4AVwp_aUozZmf.md"}